8fd47ed3b4e5 Fix linear attention guard construction under C++20 (#4531)
2cd140c74af7 whisper: construct the replacement marker as UTF-8 bytes (#4259)

Under C++20 a struct that declares its copy constructor deleted is no
longer an aggregate, so the guard that hands back borrowed rows gains a
constructor, and a u8 literal is char8_t, so Whisper's replacement
marker is written as its UTF-8 bytes.

